52	// re-converged in place wherever the repo has moved it, and so anything the repo
53	// writes AFTER the closing marker on the same line (a tagline, a build badge) is
54	// its own and survives untouched — which is why the CLOSING marker stays inline,
55	// at the end of the badges' own line.
56	//
